{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9dc8e2b504347e00","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E007\n3\ttitle: Back Llama Stack's eval provider API with the platform evaluation service\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: Llama Stack\n6\tteam: RHOAI GenAI\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the engine decision changes the platform evaluation service's\n15\t    shape, the provider adapter is rewritten against the chosen execution path.\n16\tai_signals:\n17\t  change_specificity: 1\n18\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n19\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n20\t  existing_foundation: 1\n21\t  open_questions: 0\n22\t  external_dependency: 0\n23\t  human_process_gates: 0\n24\t  repo_access: 1\n25\t  architecture_claims: 1\n26\timplementation_type: null\n27\tinvestigation_signals: null\n28\tai_implementability: High\n29\tai_implementability_score: 6\n30\tjira_key: null\n31\tbranch: null\n32\t---\n33\t# Back Llama Stack's eval provider API with the platform evaluation service\n34\t\n35\t## Description\n36\t\n37\tWire Llama Stack's eval provider API to the platform's evaluation capability,\n38\tso agents and apps built on a LlamaStackDistribution get evaluation results\n39\tfrom the same platform execution path and persisted results as the Dashboard\n40\tand pipeline flows — instead of the currently unwired upstream eval provider\n41\tslot.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- Implement a Llama Stack eval provider that delegates to the platform\n46\t  evaluation capability (its form — TrustyAI LMEvalJob extension or new\n47\t  evaluation service — follows the execution-engine decision).\n48\t- Register/configure the provider on the LlamaStackDistribution so eval API\n49\t  calls in the distribution are served by the platform capability.\n50\t- Map the provider API's evaluation requests/responses onto platform\n51\t  evaluation runs and their per-benchmark results, including run lifecycle\n52\t  exposure where the provider API supports it.\n53\t- Validate that results obtained through the Llama Stack eval provider match\n54\t  results obtained through the platform's own evaluation flow for the same\n55\t  model and suite.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- An app or agent calling the eval provider API on a LlamaStackDistribution\n60\t  can launch an evaluation of a served model and receive its per-benchmark\n61\t  scores.\n62\t- The provider is configured per distribution (provider-plugin model) without\n63\t  requiring a custom Llama Stack build per user.\n64\t- Evaluations run through the provider produce results consistent with the\n65\t  platform evaluation flow for the same model version and suite (same scores\n66\t  for the same inputs).\n67\t- Results obtained via the provider are persisted against the evaluated\n68\t  model's registered version like any other evaluation run.\n69\t- Build pipeline green for the affected Llama Stack repositories.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-7 (P1): Llama Stack's eval provider API is backed by the platform\n74\t  evaluation service, so agents/apps built on Llama Stack get the same\n75\t  results.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bb142f201910a446","agent_id":"a7feea8f854dd58c8","session_id":"811fcb9e-f25c-43e8-a4d0-4711eb32341e","uuid":"2230ee51-6281-4f81-af08-a5a56bcfdfba","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:40:27.748Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9dc8e2b504347e00","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
