{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b621ef48d7e9d989","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E009\n3\ttitle: Evaluation step for Data Science Pipelines\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: Data Science Pipelines\n6\tteam: RHOAI Pipelines\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the engine decision changes the evaluation launch interface,\n15\t    the pipeline step is rewritten against the chosen interface.\n16\tai_signals:\n17\t  change_specificity: 1\n18\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n19\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n20\t  existing_foundation: 1\n21\t  open_questions: 0\n22\t  external_dependency: 1\n23\t  human_process_gates: 1\n24\t  repo_access: 1\n25\t  architecture_claims: 1\n26\timplementation_type: null\n27\tinvestigation_signals: null\n28\tai_implementability: High\n29\tai_implementability_score: 7\n30\tjira_key: null\n31\tbranch: null\n32\t---\n33\t# Evaluation step for Data Science Pipelines\n34\t\n35\t## Description\n36\t\n37\tMake an evaluation embeddable as a step in a Data Science Pipeline, so\n38\tpromotion flows can gate on evaluation scores: a pipeline runs an evaluation of\n39\ta candidate model and uses its scores in downstream decisions (humans still\n40\tmake the promotion decision — automatic promotion is out of scope).\n41\t\n42\t## Scope\n43\t\n44\t- Provide a pipeline step/component (KFP v2) that launches an evaluation of a\n45\t  served model against a selected benchmark suite via the evaluation execution\n46\t  capability's launch interface, waits for completion, and fails or branches\n47\t  based on the outcome.\n48\t- Expose the run's per-benchmark scores as step output so downstream steps can\n49\t  gate on them (threshold checks, comparisons).\n50\t- Ensure the step works within DataSciencePipelinesApplication instances (Argo\n51\t  Workflows backend) with standard step patterns.\n52\t- Document (in the step's usage material) how a promotion-gating flow composes\n53\t  the evaluation step with score-threshold decisions.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- A KFP v2 pipeline can include an evaluation step that launches an evaluation\n58\t  of a specified served model against a specified suite and completes with the\n59\t  run's terminal status.\n60\t- The step's outputs include the per-benchmark scores of the run, consumable\n61\t  by downstream steps for threshold gating.\n62\t- A pipeline containing the evaluation step runs to completion on a\n63\t  DataSciencePipelinesApplication instance and is visible in the existing\n64\t  pipeline run views.\n65\t- A promotion-gating example flow (evaluate candidate, gate on score\n66\t  threshold, human decides promotion) is demonstrated end to end.\n67\t- Build pipeline green for the affected pipelines repositories.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-6 (P1): evaluations can be embedded as a step in a Data Science Pipeline\n72\t  so promotion flows can gate on scores.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b2d0cf6b1f46f74d","agent_id":"a98001a3ef0046ed5","session_id":"811fcb9e-f25c-43e8-a4d0-4711eb32341e","uuid":"ba2ae44f-03a4-4d78-b29c-e8495ba00fd0","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:02:21.516Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b621ef48d7e9d989","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
